@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-2
`the train is refunded with every other means of public transport, edition 9` MEANS
    `the train is refunded with every other means of public transport, edition 8`

@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-3
